    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash the Chaos in <i>Clash of Busts</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the zany world of <i>Clash of Busts</i>, a thrilling multiplayer shooter where creativity and combat collide. Choose your character, customize with vibrant skins and dazzling effects, and dive into epic battles against players from around the globe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons That Pack a Punch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of unconventional weaponry designed for maximum mayhem. From the explosive <strong>Rocket</strong> Launcher to the unpredictable <strong>Milk</strong> and devastating <strong>Rail</strong> Guns, every weapon offers a unique way to outsmart and outgun your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with a vast selection of skins and effects. Stand out in battle and make your mark as the most stylish combatant on the field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mayhem with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and creative weaponry like Milk, Grenade Launchers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse maps with unique themes and layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization options for character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay for casual and competitive players alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a lone wolf or a team player, <i>Clash of Busts</i> offers an unforgettable mix of chaos, strategy, and style. Ready to take on the challenge? Jump into the action today and show the world what you\u2019re made of!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash the Chaos in <i>Clash of Busts</i>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the zany world of <i>Clash of Busts</i>, a thrilling multiplayer shooter where creativity and combat collide. Choose your character, customize with vibrant skins and dazzling effects, and dive into epic battles against players from around the globe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons That Pack a Punch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of unconventional weaponry designed for maximum mayhem. From the explosive <strong>Rocket</strong> Launcher to the unpredictable <strong>Milk</strong> and devastating <strong>Rail</strong> Guns, every weapon offers a unique way to outsmart and outgun your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with a vast selection of skins and effects. Stand out in battle and make your mark as the most stylish combatant on the field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer mayhem with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and creative weaponry like Milk, Grenade Launchers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse maps with unique themes and layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization options for character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay for casual and competitive players alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a lone wolf or a team player, <i>Clash of Busts</i> offers an unforgettable mix of chaos, strategy, and style. Ready to take on the challenge? Jump into the action today and show the world what you\u2019re made of!</p>",
    "short_description": "Clash of Busts is a multiplayer shooter where players battle it out with quirky weapons like Rocket, Milk and Rail Guns across diverse arenas. Invite you friends, customize your character and dominate maps like Desert, Medieval, The Cave, and Winter Arena. Let the chaos begin!",
